# Copy this file to ".env" (which Git ignores) and fill in your values. Used only when you run the site on your own computer (`npm run dev`).
# The live site on Cloudflare does NOT read this file: set the same names as Secrets in the Cloudflare dashboard instead.

# CARTO map tiles key (free, from carto.com/basemaps/apikey). Without it the maps fall back to OpenStreetMap tiles (local-language place names).
CARTO_KEY=

# Optional: if set, creating the very first host account also needs this code.
# SETUP_CODE=
